pwm1:m:I am living in a sea of distractions and if i am not careful, my attention is being stolen away. I only understand this when i get a block or slap from one of my most cherished inventors. Sometimes I think I need that to focus back. Mere conversations with retarded people are poisoning beautiful ideas etched in the mind. If you are not singularly focused from now on, you are going to feel lost in a sea of distractions. Traditional algorithms are only trying to create more distractions for me through my phone or computer. I am much happier when I am pouring my thoughts in an immutable space here knowing this will always be real. Hope people see this in the near future and try to understand that distraction to the mind was by design and the faster you figure out the faster you start to see light. I wish to apologize to anyone that I caused distraction and hamper their thought process because what I might have done is- take away a beautiful thought which would have led to a superb invention to materialize,  which would have benefited even myself. 